5,0,1,talk,Minako,,Let's keep our heads clear. We need a systematic way to identify the werewolf since we have no information yet.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh my, this is quite a frightening game, isn't it? I just hope we can all be honest with one another.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Honesty is a luxury here, Shizue. I'll be watching for any logical inconsistencies in everyone's statements.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A fair approach, Mizuki. I believe a balance of intuition and evidence will be our best tool for survival.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm sure we can figure this out together! I trust you guys, so let's just do our best!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minako,,"Trust is useful, Kenji, but blind trust is a liability. We must prioritize factual evidence over feelings.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"You're so stern, Minako. But I suppose that's why we rely on you to lead us.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Exactly. We should focus on how people react when the first piece of information emerges tomorrow.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. The first day's revelation is usually the most volatile. We must remain calm.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'll be cheering for everyone! We're a great team, and I know we'll find the wolf!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minako,,"Let's agree to listen to the Seer if they choose to reveal themselves, provided their claims are consistent.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a wonderful plan. I'll follow your guidance, dear.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll be cross-referencing the Seer's claims with the behavior of the accused.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,A prudent strategy. I shall observe the group's dynamics closely tonight.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm with Mizuki! Let's just be careful not to accidentally hurt any of our friends.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
