31,1,1,talk,Minako,,The first day has arrived. Does anyone have information that can help us narrow down the suspects?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I'm afraid I have nothing but my hopes that we are all safe.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The silence is telling. If there is a Seer, now is a reasonable time to speak.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Since we need a direction, I'll be direct. I divined Shizue last night, and she is the werewolf.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! Shizue? No way! She's way too sweet to be a werewolf! Benjamin, are you sure?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minako,,"That is a bold claim. Shizue, how do you respond to this accusation?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,Oh dear... I am heartbroken that Benjamin would say such a thing. I promise I'm just a simple old woman.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Kenji's immediate emotional defense of Shizue is interesting. Benjamin, why reveal yourself so early?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,To prevent the werewolf from picking off the most informed player. The result was unambiguous.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,Maybe Benjamin is just confused? Or maybe he's the wolf trying to trick us!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Kenji, your defense is based on personality, not logic. Benjamin's claim is a factual assertion of his role.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It's so sad to think there is such distrust among us. I only wish for peace.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Shizue's reaction is perfectly consistent with her persona, which is exactly what a werewolf would do.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Precisely. The ""innocent grandmother"" act is a classic diversion.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,But look at her! She's shaking! We can't just execute her based on one person's word!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minako,,"We have a direct claim from the Seer. Unless there's a logical reason to doubt Benjamin, we must act.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"Please, believe me... I couldn't possibly hurt any of you.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,The evidence provided by the Seer outweighs the emotional appeal. I vote for Shizue.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I stand by my divination. The village is safer without her.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I still don't like this, but if everyone is so sure... I'll go with the group.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
